# The repository root ignores `.env*` wholesale, which would also swallow the
# templates. They contain no secrets and are the documented starting point
# (`cp .env.production.example .env`), so re-include them here — a deeper
# .gitignore overrides a parent's pattern.
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

